{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GEN","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"創世記","commonName":"創世記","title":"創世記","order":1,"numberOfChapters":50,"sha256":"c386c509bcaf2d2e415b454ca78f5cfd89495b0f945d3896fb5dab5baca206b4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":50,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/50.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1532},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["閃、含、雅弗的後代"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["挪亞的兒子閃、含、雅弗的後代記在下面。洪水以後，他們都生了兒子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["雅弗的兒子是歌篾、瑪各、瑪代、雅完、土巴、米設、提拉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["歌篾的兒子是亞實基拿、利法、陀迦瑪。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["雅完的兒子是以利沙、他施、基提、多單。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["這些人的後裔將各國的地土、海島分開居住，各隨各的方言、宗族立國。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["含的兒子是古實、麥西、弗、迦南。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["古實的兒子是西巴、哈腓拉、撒弗他、拉瑪、撒弗提迦。拉瑪的兒子是示巴、底但。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["古實又生寧錄，他為世上英雄之首。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他在耶和華面前是個英勇的獵戶，所以俗語說：「像寧錄在耶和華面前是個英勇的獵戶。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他國的起頭是巴別、以力、亞甲、甲尼，都在示拿地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["他從那地出來往亞述去，建造尼尼微、利河伯、迦拉，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["和尼尼微、迦拉中間的利鮮，這就是那大城。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["麥西生路低人、亞拿米人、利哈比人、拿弗土希人、"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["帕斯魯細人、迦斯路希人、迦斐託人；從迦斐託出來的有非利士人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["迦南生長子西頓，又生赫"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["和耶布斯人、亞摩利人、革迦撒人、"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["希未人、亞基人、西尼人、"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["亞瓦底人、洗瑪利人、哈馬人，後來迦南的諸族分散了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["迦南的境界是從西頓向基拉耳的路上，直到迦薩，又向所多瑪、蛾摩拉、押瑪、洗扁的路上，直到拉沙。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["這就是含的後裔，各隨他們的宗族、方言，所住的地土、邦國。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["雅弗的哥哥閃，是希伯子孫之祖，他也生了兒子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["閃的兒子是以攔、亞述、亞法撒、路德、亞蘭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["亞蘭的兒子是烏斯、戶勒、基帖、瑪施。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["亞法撒生沙拉；沙拉生希伯。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["希伯生了兩個兒子，一個名叫法勒",{"noteId":3},"，因為那時人就分地居住；法勒的兄弟名叫約坍。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["約坍生亞摩答、沙列、哈薩瑪非、耶拉、"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["哈多蘭、烏薩、德拉、"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["俄巴路、亞比瑪利、示巴、"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["阿斐、哈腓拉、約巴，這都是約坍的兒子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":["他們所住的地方是從米沙直到西發東邊的山。"]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":["這就是閃的子孫，各隨他們的宗族、方言，所住的地土、邦國。"]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":["這些都是挪亞三個兒子的宗族，各隨他們的支派立國。洪水以後，他們在地上分為邦國。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"-","text":"就是分的意思","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":25}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":32}